{"1851626898557640704":{"a":"<p>@covertress When I was a kid only two people knew how to play the two Carrilon in town. They both died. How would you even practice today? People would complain about the noise if you did play enough to become good. 🙄🤷‍♂️</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1851264739831058567\">https://x.com/i/status/1851264739831058567</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1851626898557640704</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1851626898557640704\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-30T14:07:08Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1851631541148860641":{"a":"<p>@covertress Yep, at least two here in Indy. Scottish Rite Cathedral downtown I believe still chimes on the hour at least. I&#x27;ve not heard of anyone playing the manual in a long while. They used to play twelve nights of Christmas for twelve nights.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1851630210715689057\">https://x.com/i/status/1851630210715689057</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1851631541148860641</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1851631541148860641\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-30T14:25:35Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1851633191150297293":{"a":"<p>@covertress Almost the largest in the US. t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1851631541148860641\">https://x.com/i/status/1851631541148860641</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1851633191150297293\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1851633191150297293</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1851633191150297293</h1>\n